gm8-lib
=======

Reads, patches and writes GameMaker 8 game files.

Built on gm8exe and gml-parser, extracted from OpenGMK
<https://github.com/OpenGMK/OpenGMK>, which are licensed GPL-2.0-only. This
library is therefore GPL-2.0-only; see LICENSE. Copyright in the original work
is retained by the OpenGMK authors and contributors.

New work in this repository is Copyright (C) 2026 Dapper Mink, licensed
GPL-2.0-only on the same terms.

GPL-2.0-only is incompatible with GPL-3.0: this library cannot be linked into a
work that also contains GPL-3.0 code.

Third-party component
---------------------

`gm8exe/vendor/http_dll8` embeds Http Dll 2.3 by Maarten Baert, a GameMaker extension DLL
distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License. Its documentation is saved under
`gm8exe/vendor/http-dll-2/`, and its source and licence are published at
<https://www.maartenbaert.be/game-maker-dlls/http-dll-2/>. It is a separate work: it is not
covered by this library's GPL-2.0-only licence, and is redistributed inside every game that
`gm8exe::mods::patch_exe` produces.
